# Debian source packaging

The package uses quilt for patch management. `debian/rules` includes
`/usr/share/quilt/quilt.make`; use the quilt documentation installed by your Debian
build environment for its patch workflow. Dependency declarations are in
`debian/control`; the build and installation steps are in `debian/rules`.

See [contributing](../CONTRIBUTING.md) and [releases](../docs/releases/README.md)
for the repository's compatibility and distribution requirements.
